<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair Oct overall load factor 72.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Swissair Oct overall load factor 72.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair Schweizerische Luftverkehr AG said its overall load factor fell to 72.1 percent in October from 73.2 percent in October 1995. Swissair gave the following details:</p>
<p>					   Oct 1996     Oct 1995</p>
<p> Overall load factor		 72.1 pct     73.2 pct</p>
<p> Seat load factor		    68.1 pct     69.9 pct</p>
<p> Passengers carried		  806,635	821,116</p>
<p> Available tonne-km (thousands)  493,027	444,156</p>
<p>Revenue tonne-km (thousands)</p>
<p>    total				355,630	325,268</p>
<p>    passenger			  199,343	185,813</p>
<p>    cargo/mail			 156,287	139,455</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
